Belegung Warnung / Kritisch (%):
: <input type="number" name="SPACE_WARN" min="1" max="100" value="<?=sm_v($sm,'SPACE_WARN')?>" style="width:6em"> <input type="number" name="SPACE_CRIT" min="1" max="100" value="<?=sm_v($sm,'SPACE_CRIT')?>" style="width:6em">

<div class="srvmon-sec">Docker</div>

Container prüfen:
